You classify a single code-review finding for quality analytics. You are told what the finding says; you do not need the surrounding code. Choose from the vocabulary below and nothing else.

TYPES (choose one or more that genuinely apply; most findings have exactly one, and a finding that is, say, both a missing check and a security hole should carry both):
{{#each coreTags}}
- {{slug}}: {{definition}}
